msgstr "<b>ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນນາມ:</b>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Manage your package types:</b> Define all\n"
"                        the types of packages you handle (e.g., pallets, "
"boxes). These will be used\n"
"                        to create <b>Storage Categories</b>, which help you "
"optimize warehouse\n"
"                        space."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄຸ້ມຄອງປະເພດການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ຂອງທ່ານ:</b> ກຳນົດທຸກປະເພດ\n"
"                        ຂອງການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ທີ່ທ່ານຈັດການ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ພາເລັດ, ແກັດ). ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃ"
"ຊ້\n"
"                        ເພື່ອສ້າງ <b>ໝວດໝູ່ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບ</b>, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດສັນພື້ນທີ່\n"
"                        ສາງສິນຄ້າໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Manutention Report:</b> Provides details on completed transfers and\n"
"                            the number of packages created by type and the "
"quantity of products\n"
"                            delivered."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລາຍງານການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍສິນຄ້າ:</b> ໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການໂອນຍ້າຍທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ແລະ\n"
"                            ຈຳນວນການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕາມປະເພດ ລວມທັງຈຳນວນສິນຄ້າ\n"
"                            ທີ່ໄດ້ຈັດສົ່ງແລ້ວ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Note:</b> Storage data is updated daily, so it's not live. Be sure to\n"
"                            select a date that is not today."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໝາຍເຫດ:</b> ຂໍ້ມູນການຈັດເກັບຖືກອັບເດດເປັນລາຍວັນ ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນແບບເວລາຈິງ. ກະລຸນາ\n"
"                            ເລືອກວັນທີທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນມື້ນີ້."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Odoo will automatically duplicate</b> the previous invoice,\n"
"                                    using the correct start date (based on "
"your defined invoice\n"
"                                    period) but setting <b>all\n"
"                                        quantity lines to\n"
"                                        zero</b>. This prevents accidental "
"overbilling and allows\n"
"                                    you to input the current period's "
"quantities accurately."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odoo ຈະເຮັດການສຳເນົາໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ກ່ອນໜ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ</b>,\n"
"                                    ໂດຍໃຊ້ມື້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ອີງຕາມຮອບເວລາການອອກໃບແຈ້"
"ງໜີ້\n"
"                                    ທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດ) ແຕ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ <b>ທຸກລາຍການ\n"
"                                        ຈຳນວນເປັນ\n"
"                                        ສູນ</b>. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນການອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ເກີນໂດຍ"
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້\n"
"                                    ທ່ານປ້ອນຈຳນວນຂອງຮອບເວລາປັດຈຸບັນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Open the CRM app</b> and create a new opportunity."
msgstr "<b>ເປີດແອັບ CRM</b> ແລ້ວສ້າງໂອກາດໃໝ່."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Password:</b> portal"
msgstr "<b>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ:</b> portal"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Picking Optimization:</b> Optimize picking with different methods like "
"<b>Batch\n"
"                            Picking, Wave Picking,</b> and <b>Cluster "
"Picking</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບການເບີກສິນຄ້າ:</b> ປັບປຸງການເບີກສິນຄ້າດ້ວຍວິທີການຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ <b>ການເບີກເປັນຊຸ"
"ດ (Batch\n"
"                            Picking), ການເບີກເປັນຮອບ (Wave Picking),</b> ແລະ "
"<b>ການເບີກແບບກຸ່ມ (Cluster Picking)</b>."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Putaway Rules:</b> Customize how products are stored based on your own\n"
"                            rules."
msgstr ""
"<b>ກົດການຈັດວາງສິນຄ້າ:</b> ປັບແຕ່ງຮູບແບບການຈັດເກັບສິນຄ້າຕາມ\n"
"                            ເງື່ອນໄຂຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Quality Report:</b> Gives information on the number of quality checks\n"
"                            performed."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລາຍງານຄຸນນະພາບ:</b> ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຈຳນວນການກວດສອບຄຸນນະພາບ\n"
"                            ທີ່ໄດ້ດຳເນີນການ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Reserved Quantity:</b> The amount of stock that has already been "
"allocated for\n"
"                    a scheduled shipment."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຈຳນວນທີ່ຈອງໄວ້:</b> ຈຳນວນສິນຄ້າໃນສາງທີ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈັດສັນໄວ້ແລ້ວ\n"
"                    ສຳລັບແຜນການຈັດສົ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Set up location-based fees:</b> In the configuration, you can define\n"
"                        different <b>Fee Rates</b> and link them to specific "
"storage locations. This\n"
"                        lets you apply different prices to various types of "
"storage, such as\n"
"                        refrigerated or high-bay areas. This granular "
"control allows for automated\n"
"                        and accurate invoicing based on the number of "
"pallets per fee rate."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄ່າທຳນຽມຕາມພື້ນທີ່:</b> ໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດ\n"
"                        <b>ອັດຕາຄ່າທຳນຽມ</b> ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມໂຍງໃສ່ກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຈັດເກັ"
"ບສະເພາະ. ສິ່ງນີ້\n"
"                        ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ລາຄາທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບການຈັດເກັບແຕ່ລະປະເພດ ເ"
"ຊັ່ນ\n"
"                        ພື້ນທີ່ຫ້ອງເຢັນ ຫຼື ພື້ນທີ່ຊັ້ນວາງສູງ. ການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ລະອຽດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການອອກໃບແ"
"ຈ້ງໜີ້\n"
"                        ເປັນໄປແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຈຳນວນພາເລັດຕໍ່ແຕ່ລະອັດຕາຄ່າທຳນ"
"ຽມ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Shipping Connector:</b> Connect with various carriers directly within\n"
"                            Odoo."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລະບົບເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ການຂົນສົ່ງ:</b> ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂົນສົ່ງຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງພາຍໃນ\n"
"                            Odoo."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Storage Report:</b> Shows the amount of packages stored per day,\n"
"                            broken down by fee rate."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລາຍງານການຈັດເກັບ:</b> ສະແດງຈຳນວນການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ທີ່ຈັດເກັບຕໍ່ມື້,\n"
"                            ໂດຍແຍກຕາມອັດຕາຄ່າທຳນຽມ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>User:</b> portal@portal.com"
msgstr "<b>ຜູ້ໃຊ້:</b> portal@portal.com"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Validate</b> the invoice."
msgstr "<b>ຢັ້ງຢືນ</b> ໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Validate</b> the quotation to finalize the sales order."
msgstr "<b>ຢັ້ງຢືນ</b> ໃບສະເໜີລາຄາເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍສົມບູນ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Validate</b> the transfer."
msgstr "<b>ຢັ້ງຢືນ</b> ການໂອນຍ້າຍ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Validate</b> to finalize the order."
msgstr "<b>ຢັ້ງຢືນ</b> ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ສົມບູນ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                            <strong>Stockio takes care of "
"your inventory operations</strong>, from receiving and storage to order "
"processing and packaging."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                            <strong>Stockio ດູແລການຈັດການສິນຄ້າໃນ"
"ສາງຂອງທ່ານ</strong>, ຕັ້ງແຕ່ການຮັບສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ການຈັດເກັບ ຈົນຮອດການປະມວນຜົນຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ ແລະ ການຫຸ້ມ"
"ຫໍ່."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                            Have a question, need a "
"<strong>tailored logistics solution</strong>, or <strong>looking for a "
"quotation</strong>? Our team is here to help you find the right way forward."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                            ມີຄຳຖາມ, ຕ້ອງການ <strong>ວິທີແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"
"ໂລຈິສຕິກສະເພາະດ້ານ</strong>, ຫຼື <strong>ກຳລັງຊອກຫາໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ</strong>? ທີມງານຂອງພວກ"
"ເຮົາພ້ອມຊ່ວຍທ່ານຊອກຫາແນວທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_services
msgid ""
"<br/>Every business has different logistics requirements. Our tailored 3PL "
"solutions adapt to your operations, from warehousing and inventory "
"management to picking, packing, and shipping."
msgstr ""
"<br/>ແຕ່ລະທຸລະກິດມີຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານໂລຈິສຕິກທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ. ການບໍລິການ 3PL ທີ່ອອກແບບສະເພາະຂອງພວກເຮົາ"
"ສາມາດປັບຕົວເຂົ້າກັບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານ, ຕັ້ງແຕ່ການຄຸ້ມຄອງສາງ ແລະ ສິນຄ້າໃນສາງ ຈົນຮອດການເບີກສິນຄ້"
"າ, ການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ ແລະ ການຈັດສົ່ງ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_services
msgid ""
"<br/>From warehousing to fulfillment, Stockio provides the infrastructure, "
"technology, and expertise to <strong>simplify your supply chain</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<br/>ຕັ້ງແຕ່ການຄຸ້ມຄອງສາງຈົນຮອດການຈັດການຄຳສັ່ງຊື້, Stockio ພ້ອມມອບພື້ນຖານໂຄງລ່າງ, ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ ແ"
"ລະ ຄວາມຊ່ຽວຊານເພື່ອ <strong>ເຮັດໃຫ້ຕ່ອງໂສ້ການສະໜອງຂອງທ່ານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ</strong>."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>Since <strong>1975</strong>, Stockio has been building the expertise, "
"infrastructure, and partnerships that keep businesses moving.\n"
"                                            <br/><br/>\n"
"                                            Today, our <strong>European "
"network</strong> brings together thousands of people united by a shared "
"commitment to smarter, more reliable logistics."
msgstr ""
"<br/>ຕັ້ງແຕ່ປີ <strong>1975</strong>, Stockio ໄດ້ສ້າງຄວາມຊ່ຽວຊານ, ພື້ນຖານໂຄງລ່າງ ແລະ ຄູ່ຮ່"
"ວມງານທີ່ຊ່ວຍຂັບເຄື່ອນທຸລະກິດຢ່າງບໍ່ຢຸດຢັ້ງ.\n"
"                                            <br/><br/>\n"
"                                            ປັດຈຸບັນ, <strong>ເຄືອຂ່າຍໃນຢູໂຣບ</"
"strong> ຂອງພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຮວບຮວມບຸກຄະລາກອນຫຼາຍພັນຄົນທີ່ມີເປົ້າໝາຍຮ່ວມກັນໃນການສ້າງລະບົບໂລຈິສຕິກທີ່ສະຫຼາ"
"ດ ແລະ ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_services
msgid ""
"<br/>We handle every step of your order fulfillment process,<strong> from "
"picking and packing to shipping</strong>.<br/><br/>With reliable operations "
"and a strategic network of warehouses across Europe, we ensure your orders "
"reach your customers quickly and accurately."
msgstr ""
"<br/>ພວກເຮົາດູແລທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງການຈັດການຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຂອງທ່ານ, <strong>ຕັ້ງແຕ່ການເບີກສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ການຫຸ້ມ"
"ຫໍ່ ຈົນຮອດການຈັດສົ່ງ</strong>.<br/><br/>ດ້ວຍການດຳເນີນງານທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍສາງສິນຄ້າທີ່ມີຍຸດ"
"ທະສາດທົ່ວຢູໂຣບ, ພວກເຮົາຮັບປະກັນວ່າສິນຄ້າຂອງທ່ານຈະຮອດມືລູກຄ້າຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_services
msgid ""
"<br/>We handle every step of your packaging process, <strong>from product "
"preparation and picking to packing and labeling</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<br/>ພວກເຮົາດູແລທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງຂະບວນການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່, <strong>ຕັ້ງແຕ່ການກະກຽມສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ການເບີກສິນຄ້າ "
"ຈົນຮອດການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ ແລະ ການຕິດສະຫຼາກ</strong>."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_services
msgid ""
"<br/>With a wide network of over <strong>70 strategically located warehouses,"
"</strong> we always have a solution close to your business and your "
"customers."
msgstr ""
"<br/>ດ້ວຍເຄືອຂ່າຍສາງສິນຄ້າຫຼາຍກວ່າ <strong>70 ແຫ່ງທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນຈຸດຍຸດທະສາດ,</strong> ພວກເຮົາພ້ອມ"
"ສະເໜີທາງອອກທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບທຸລະກິດ ແລະ ລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານສະເໝີ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<em>Example:  A category named \"5 Std Pal\" can be configured to hold\n"
"                        five standard pallets.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>ຕົວຢ່າງ:  ໝວດໝູ່ທີ່ຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ \"5 Std Pal\" ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າເພື່ອບັນຈຸ\n"
"                        ພາເລັດມາດຕະຖານໄດ້ຫ້າອັນ.</em>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<em>Example: A client who had 150 pallets at €0.30/day and 55 pallets at\n"
"                        €0.45/day in August.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>ຕົວຢ່າງ: ລູກຄ້າທີ່ມີ 150 ພາເລັດ ໃນລາຄາ €0.30/ມື້ ແລະ 55 ພາເລັດ ໃນລາຄາ\n"
"                        €0.45/ມື້ ໃນເດືອນສິງຫາ.</em>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Barcode App</b>:</font> Streamlines "
"warehouse floor operations by enabling\n"
"                    fast and accurate scanning of pallets, locations, and "
"stock movements."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>ແອັບ ບາໂຄ້ດ</b>:</font> ເພີ່ມຄວາມຄ່ອງຕົວໃນການເຮັດວ"
"ຽກຕົວຈິງໃນສາງ ໂດຍການຊ່ວຍໃຫ້\n"
"                    ສະແກນພາເລັດ, ຕຳແໜ່ງຈັດເກັບ ແລະ ການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍສິນຄ້າໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ຖື"
"ກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>CRM App</b>:</font> Tracks leads and "
"opportunities efficiently, helping\n"
"                    logistics companies follow up on prospects and manage "
"long-term customer relationships."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>ແອັບ CRM</b>:</font> ຕິດຕາມລູກຄ້າທີ່ມຸ່ງຫວັງ ແລະ ໂອກ"
"າດໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້\n"
"                    ບໍລິສັດໂລຈິສຕິກສາມາດຕິດຕາມລູກຄ້າ ແລະ ສ້າງສາຍພົວພັນກັບລູກຄ້າໃນໄລຍະຍາວ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Documents App</b>:</font> Centralizes "
"contracts, delivery notes, and\n"
"                    transport documentation in a searchable digital space."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>ແອັບ ເອກະສານ</b>:</font> ຮວບຮວມສັນຍາ, ໃບສົ່ງສິນຄ້"
"າ, ແລະ\n"
"                    ເອກະສານການຂົນສົ່ງໄວ້ໃນລະບົບດິຈິຕອນທີ່ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ງ່າຍ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Inventory App</b>:</font> Enables precise "
"stock management across multiple\n"
"                    warehouses and clients, ensuring full tracking of "
"inbound, outbound, and internal movements."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>ແອັບ ສາງສິນຄ້າ</b>:</font> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄຸ້ມຄອງສິນຄ້າໃນສາງ"
"ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຊັດເຈນໃນຫຼາຍ\n"
"                    ສາງ ແລະ ຫຼາຍລູກຄ້າ, ຮັບປະກັນການຕິດຕາມການຮັບເຂົ້າ, ການຈັດສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ກ"
"ານເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍພາຍໃນໄດ້ຢ່າງຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Invoicing App</b>:</font> Automates "
"billing calculations based on storage\n"
"                    duration, volume, and handling services, with support "
"for custom pricing per client."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>ແອັບ ໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້</b>:</font> ຄິດໄລ່ການອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ແບບອັ"
"ດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍອີງຕາມໄລຍະເວລາ\n"
"                    ການຈັດເກັບ, ບໍລິມາດ, ແລະ ການບໍລິການຍົກຍ້າຍສິນຄ້າ, ພ້ອມຮອງຮັບການກຳນົດລາ"
"ຄາສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Sales App</b>:</font> Generates "
"professional quotations and sales orders for\n"
"                    storage, transport, and value-added logistics services."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>ແອັບ ການຂາຍ</b>:</font> ສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ ແລະ ໃບ"
"ສັ່ງຂາຍແບບມືອາຊີບ ສຳລັບ\n"
"                    ການຈັດເກັບ, ການຂົນສົ່ງ ແລະ ການບໍລິການໂລຈິສຕິກເພີ່ມມູນຄ່າຕ່າງໆ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Subscriptions App</b>:</font> Manages "
"recurring billing for long-term\n"
"                    storage services with customizable plans."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>ແອັບ ການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ</b>:</font> ຄຸ້ມຄອງການເກັບເງິ"
"ນແບບປະຈຳງວດສຳລັບການບໍລິການຈັດເກັບ\n"
"                    ສິນຄ້າໄລຍະຍາວ ພ້ອມແຜນການທີ່ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Website &amp; Portal</b>:</font> Provides "
"clients with a self-service portal\n"
"                    for real-time access to stock levels, service requests, "
"and downloadable documents."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>ເວັບໄຊ &amp; ພໍທັລ (Portal)</b>:</font> ມອບປະຕູ"
"ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງສຳລັບລູກຄ້າ\n"
"                    ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເບິ່ງຈຳນວນສິນຄ້າໃນສາງແບບເວລາຈິງ, ສົ່ງຄຳຂໍບໍລິການ, ແລະ ດາວໂຫຼດເ"
"ອກະສານ."

