"internal product\n"
"                purchasing.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">ໃຊ້ແອັບ <b>ການຈັດຊື້</b> ເພື່ອຄຸ້ມຄອງການຈັດຊື້ສິນຄ້າ\n"
"                ພາຍໃນທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ.</span>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
