"                    <font style=\"color: rgb(113, 75, 103);\">ແພັກເກດບໍລິສັດໂລຈິສຕິ"
"ກ Odoo</font>\n"
"                </strong>\n"
"                !</span>\n"
"            <br/>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">When you need to manually move stock—like returning "
"items to a\n"
"                quality check location or moving products after a customer "
"validation—use an\n"
"                internal transfer.<strong/></span>\n"
"            <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍສິນຄ້າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ເຊັ່ນ: ການສົ່ງສິນຄ້າຄືນໄປຍັງ\n"
"                ຈຸດກວດສອບຄຸນນະພາບ ຫຼື ການຍ້າຍສິນຄ້າຫຼັງຈາກລູກຄ້າຢັ້ງຢືນແລ້ວ—ໃຫ້ໃຊ້\n"
"                ການໂອນຍ້າຍພາຍໃນ.<strong/></span>\n"
"            <br/>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">You can add specific quality checks required by your "
"customer. For\n"
"                each check, define how it should be performed, when it "
"should be completed, and\n"
"                which samples it applies to.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມລາຍການກວດສອບຄຸນນະພາບສະເພາະຕາມທີ່ລູກຄ້າຕ້ອງການໄດ້. ສ"
"ຳລັບ\n"
"                ແຕ່ລະການກວດສອບ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດວິທີການປະຕິບັດ, ກຳນົດເວລາສຳເລັດ, ແລະ\n"
"                ກຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງກວດສອບ.</span>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
